% The constraints `tell/N` reaches from the other module. `note/2` and
% `pair/3` are exported; `secret/2` is not, so `client` cannot name it,
% statically or dynamically.
:- module(tell_provider, [note/2, pair/3, twin/2]).

:- chr_constraint note/2, pair/3, secret/2, twin/2.

note(X, R) <=> R is X + 1.
pair(A, B, R) <=> R is A * 10 + B.
secret(X, R) <=> R is X + 100.
twin(X, R) <=> R is X + 1000.
